### ============================================================
### Utility endpoints
### ============================================================

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### ETL status
GET {{prefix}}/admin/etl/status

### ETL trigger full sync
POST {{prefix}}/admin/etl/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sync_type": "full"
}
